[00:07.94]Come with rejoicing, and learn about Jehovah.
[00:14.30]“Come drink life’s water,” the spirit has said.
[00:22.70]Healthful instruction, God has provided.
[00:29.14]All those who hunger for truth will be fed.
[00:36.08]Never forsaking our gathering together,
[00:48.85]We must be taught; we must learn what is right.
[00:56.29]Here with God’s spirit, here with our brothers,
[01:03.32]Here we are strengthened to walk in the light.
[01:30.54]Lips that sing praise, how encouraging to hear them!
[01:37.66]Tongues of the taught ones, how sweet is their sound!
[01:44.64]Oh, may we always meet with God’s people!
[01:52.07]Oh, may we always among them be found!
